# Build-time config for the Android APK (`npm run build:mobile`).
#
# Copy this file to `.env.mobile`. Unlike the web deployment, the APK is built
# locally, so this cannot come from the Vercel dashboard — it is baked into the
# bundle at build time.
#
# This MUST be an absolute https:// URL reachable from the device. It cannot be
# localhost: inside the WebView, localhost is the app's own bundled assets.
#
# To build against a local backend instead, use the dev machine's LAN address
# (e.g. http://192.168.x.x:8000) or http://10.0.2.2:8000 on the emulator —
# capacitor.config.ts detects the http:// scheme and adjusts the WebView origin
# automatically. See ANDROID.md.
VITE_API_URL=https://uwindsor-accs-7k3r.onrender.com
